                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "Best pasta I\u0027ve tasted in Taipei. My husband who is particular about his pasta also said the pasta here was really good. I ordered the creamy bacon pasta and a full set addition with bread, salad, drinks, and dessert. Love all but for the salad, I picked the Japanese salad and it was a bit weird for me because they mixed balsamic vinegar with sesame sauce. It was edible but not recommended by me.",
